    <item>
      <title>Day0 - Let there be Loom</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/blog/day0-let-there-be-loom/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 May 2021 14:51:12 +0600</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/blog/day0-let-there-be-loom/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;sect1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;_what_is_loom&#34;&gt;What is Loom?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;sectionbody&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;paragraph&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Loom is a headless media asset management server platform. It provides tools to inventory your media assets and extract the most information from them. The Loom Sever can be used to query the data in a structured way with either REST or GraphQL. Additional metadata can be stored in Loom alongside to your assets.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
