    <item>
      <title>Pipeline Mechanism</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/docs/pipeline/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/docs/pipeline/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div id=&#34;preamble&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;sectionbody&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;paragraph&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; is a directed acyclic graph (DAG) of processing nodes that Cortex executes on each media asset.&#xA;Pipelines are defined in Loom (stored in the database) and loaded by Cortex at startup.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pipeline Nodes</title>
